OL,6, "It never ceases to amaze me, really,  
OL,7,  how teletext has had this sort-of     
OL,8,  afterlife."                           
OL,9,   C` Paul "Mr. Biffo" Rose, Teletext 50
OL,12, "In the beginning of Ceefax, we were   
OL,13,  discovering what you could do with the
OL,14,  graphics.                             
